{start_of_verse: Verse}
Oh [G]Lord our Lord, how [F]majestic is Your [C]name in all the [G]earth
Oh [G]Lord our Lord, how [F]majestic is Your [C]name in all the [G]earth
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
Your [Am]kingdom come, Your [C]will be done, in [Em]us as it is in [Dsus4]hea[D]ven
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
There’s [D/F#]just one [G]reason we draw [D]breath
To be Your [Am]kingdom in the [D]earth
And [D/F#]we will [G]give our very [D]lives
To see it [Am]come [D]
You [D/F#]brought us [G]together in this [D]place
There is no [Am]sacrifice too [D]great
And [D/F#]we will [G]give our very [D]lives
To see You [Am]come [D]
Reign [D/F#]in our [C]hearts, [D]reign in our [Em]hearts [G]
Reign in our [C]hearts, [D]reign in our [G]hearts
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse}
Oh [G]Lord our Lord, how [F]majestic is Your [C]name in all the [G]earth
Oh [G]Lord our Lord, how [F]majestic is Your [C]name in all the [G]earth
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
Your [Am]kingdom come, Your [C]will be done, in [Em]us as it is in [Dsus4]hea[D]ven
